1
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:12,720
How dare you!

2
00:00:13,599 --> 00:00:14,279
My country

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,480
is not worth exchanging for a woman.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,440
Your Royal Highness,

5
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:18,839
the vanguard of the Helian clan

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,199
has reached 30 miles outside the pass.

7
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:21,600
During the national mourning,

8
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,679
we are restricted by the etiquette,

9
00:00:22,719 --> 00:00:23,480
and our troops are not well prepared.

10
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,519
We are weaker than the enemy.

11
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,600
It's not a good time to start a war.

12
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:28,960
It is known to all that

13
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:30,079
the Great Chanyu of the Helian clan likes beautiful women.

14
00:00:30,679 --> 00:00:32,119
Princess Arietty is in her prime.

15
00:00:33,119 --> 00:00:34,679
The marriage is really...

16
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
The best way

17
00:00:36,679 --> 00:00:37,679
to buy time

18
00:00:37,679 --> 00:00:38,840
to prepare for the war.

19
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:41,960
Who dares to mention it again,

20
00:00:42,439 --> 00:00:43,119
I will

21
00:00:43,439 --> 00:00:44,320
hang his head

22
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,399
on the Vermilion Bird Gate

23
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,920
as a present to the Helian.

24
00:00:48,479 --> 00:00:49,039
Your Highness.

25
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:50,079
As for the marriage,

26
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,039
don't even think about it.

27
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:56,840
Get out.

28
00:00:58,159 --> 00:00:59,079
Yes, yes.

29
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,319
Don't worry.

30
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,120
I'm so horny.

31
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,159
Jianchen,

32
00:01:14,519 --> 00:01:15,640
don't be angry.

33
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:18,400
I just scared you.

34
00:01:18,719 --> 00:01:20,079
I was a bit harsh just now.

35
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,799
But it was to intimidate the ministers.

36
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,120
I didn't expect

37
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,120
to have disturbed you.

38
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,079
I thought

39
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,920
you were really going to hurt someone.

40
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:29,439
That was all an act.

41
00:01:29,719 --> 00:01:30,480
If I hadn't been tough,

42
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,840
how would the ministers have backed down?

43
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:32,519
Besides,

44
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,640
no matter how bad I am,

45
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,560
I won't hurt you

46
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,159
with a sword.

47
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,879
Brother,

48
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,640
do I really not have to get married?

49
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:41,640
Don't worry.

50
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,000
As long as I'm here,

51
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:44,879
no one will ever

52
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,400
send you there.

53
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:47,680
As for this matter,

54
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,280
Miss Feng can testify.

55
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,319
As for how to repel the enemy,

56
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,799
I have my way.

57
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,519
Don't worry.

58
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:03,560
Well.

59
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,079
It's over.

60
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,000
My neck is stiff

61
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,919
if I stay any longer.

62
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,560
Phoenix,

63
00:02:12,319 --> 00:02:13,159
how do you think

64
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,400
I performed today?

65
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,599
You were fierce enough,

66
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,719
but a little exaggerated.

67
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,280
I specially learned

68
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:24,080
from Ye Xuan.

69
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,360
He is

70
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,000
always angry.

71
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:28,240
But to be honest,

72
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,319
it's quite impressive.

73
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,520
He is indeed a problem

74
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,800
in the matter of the Helian clan.

75
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:39,840
Don't worry.

76
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,759
I have a good idea.

77
00:02:43,599 --> 00:02:44,240
Do you really have a way?

78
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:45,400
If you want to know,

79
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,520
you have to...

80
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,000
I've been trapped

81
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,360
in the body of Ye Xuan for a while.

82
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,560
I suffered a lot.

83
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:57,919
That madman

84
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,919
would fight with others when he was unhappy.

85
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,759
My white jade-like body

86
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,000
was ruined.

87
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,159
Phoenix,

88
00:03:08,599 --> 00:03:09,439
just think of it

89
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,919
as a chance to unwind with me.

90
00:03:12,479 --> 00:03:13,280
Please.

91
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:14,280
Unwind?

92
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:15,800
Just one day.

93
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:17,919
We'll have some fun,

94
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,400
and I'll

95
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,280
come up with a brilliant plan.

96
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:22,680
By then,

97
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,039
I guarantee you'll be satisfied.

98
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,680
Come on,

99
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,959
pack this up properly.

100
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:32,879
Okay.

101
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,240
Make sure it's even.

102
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:37,519
Yes, yes, be careful.

103
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:41,959
Cloud brocade.

104
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:45,480
Cloud sleeves, butterfly silk.

105
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,439
I've tried on more clothes in half an hour

106
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:48,639
than I have in half a lifetime.

107
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:50,399
Especially this one,

108
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,879
it reeks of money.

109
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:53,959
I like it.

110
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:55,120
Why not?

111
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:56,839
Dressing up a bit

112
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,120
is fitting for today,

113
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,160
such an important day.

114
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,199
What important day is it today?

115
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:02,879
Sir,

116
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,800
where should I deliver these?

117
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,920
We have a delivery cart.

118
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,319
Didn't you say you only wanted one?

119
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:10,920
That's not enough.

120
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:13,120
Deliver them all to the dock,

121
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,800
on my boat.

122
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:15,680
Got it.

123
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:17,920
Fu Yi,

124
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:20,800
it's getting late,

125
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,480
and we've bought so much stuff.

126
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,319
And we still have to take a boat.

127
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,759
Where are we going?

128
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,600
You'll find out soon enough.

129
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:28,399
Let's go buy something else.

130
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:29,319
Buy more?

131
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,920
It's rare to come out.

132
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:33,439
We should buy everything we want.

133
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:43,519
Come on.

134
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:44,800
Try it.

135
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,720
This one is good too.

136
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:09,839
Pack up

137
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:11,480
all the others

138
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,720
except this one.

139
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,600
That's too much.

140
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:17,879
It's not.

141
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,199
Phoenix.

142
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,000
Smell it.

143
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,160
It's so spicy.

144
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,399
Fu Yi,

145
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,319
did you do this on purpose?

146
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,800
Your destiny

147
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,120
is rare.

148
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,560
Your future is bright,

149
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,120
but you are lonely

150
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,680
and disconnected.

151
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,079
Your destiny

152
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,040
is like a rootless duckweed.

153
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,839
Your destinies

154
00:07:25,079 --> 00:07:26,639
are incompatible.

155
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,240
If you force it,

156
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,439
one of you

157
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,519
will die in the end.

158
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,480
Phoenix.

159
00:07:43,079 --> 00:07:43,560
What are you looking at?

160
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:44,959
Nothing.

161
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,439
Is there anywhere else

162
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,319
you want to go?

163
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,160
Let's go.

164
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,279
I'll take you

165
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,279
to the last place today.

166
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:08,319
It's been a long time.

167
00:08:08,839 --> 00:08:09,720
I don't have to think about anything.

168
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,439
Then don't think.

169
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:13,639
Today,

170
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,319
wars and politics

171
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,079
have nothing to do with you and me.

172
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,160
When this is all over,

173
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:21,240
I'm going to be

174
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,759
a wandering knight-errant,

175
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,240
fighting for justice.

176
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,759
Can your frail body handle that?

177
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,399
You're so shallow.

178
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,039
I'll just hire

179
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:34,559
a few bodyguards.

180
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,120
I don't have to do it myself.

181
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,080
The world is so vast,

182
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,440
where can't I go?

183
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,120
The world is my home,

184
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,559
where can't I stay?

185
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:45,200
Alright, alright,

186
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:45,639
Stop.

187
00:08:46,519 --> 00:08:47,480
If you keep going,

188
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,639
they'll think you're drunk.

189
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:51,399
Even if

190
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,600
you are drunk,

191
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,440
I can still take you back.

192
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:57,720
Just enjoy yourself.

193
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,039
Phoenix,

194
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,200
do you remember

195
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,759
the woman

196
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,919
I told you about?

197
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,120
Yeah.

198
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:26,559
But,

199
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,840
since

200
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:31,639
the restaurant was closed,

201
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,159
Where is that girl now?

202
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:36,200
There was never another woman.

203
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,480
There was never another girl.

204
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,799
The one I like

205
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,000
has always been

206
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,440
just you.

207
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:15,679
Alright.

208
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:17,320
Don't be so timid.

209
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,440
Come on, take a look.

210
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,159
My turf.

211
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,480
Your turf?

212
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,360
Zhiwei Courtyard

213
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:35,919
is now

214
00:10:36,799 --> 00:10:37,519
yours.

215
00:10:39,559 --> 00:10:40,039
I...

216
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,279
Fu Yi,

217
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:43,320
this is what I've saved up for years,

218
00:10:43,759 --> 00:10:44,919
for the one I love.

219
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,480
Please don't turn it down.

220
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,360
Come, let's go take a look.

221
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,960
You painted all these?

222
00:11:22,039 --> 00:11:22,879
Of course.

223
00:11:23,879 --> 00:11:24,639
Who else

224
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:26,360
could capture

225
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,320
the essence of Phoenix?

226
00:11:29,039 --> 00:11:29,399
How's that?

227
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,480
My brushwork

228
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,120
isn't inferior

229
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:34,080
to yours, is it?

230
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,000
I intended to paint these

231
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,080
until your hair

232
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,039
turned grey,

233
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,120
and show them to you

234
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:43,000
on your 60th birthday.

235
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:45,120
What a pity.

236
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:46,879
I won't have the chance.

237
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,200
What do you mean

238
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,600
by that?

239
00:11:52,519 --> 00:11:53,720
I may not understand

240
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:55,080
the books of your country,

241
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:56,519
but I can

242
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,799
read the pictures.

243
00:12:00,279 --> 00:12:01,080
You've already found

244
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,440
the way to bring Gu Jiachen back,

245
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:03,960
right?

246
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:06,879
This magic

247
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,240
can bring Gu Jiachen back

248
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,159
by killing

249
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:10,799
the rest of us.

250
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:12,879
Let me explain.

251
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:14,000
I never intended to do this.

252
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,720
I'm not blaming you.

253
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:20,039
Now that the Helian army is approaching,

254
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,559
it's best to bring him back

255
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,720
to deal with all this

256
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,120
before the war breaks out.

257
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,399
Although I'm

258
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,360
a playboy,

259
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,039
I'm good at

260
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:31,919
judging people.

261
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,279
Gu Jiachen

262
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:35,799
is diligent and careful.

263
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:37,000
He's been the Crown Prince for so many years.

264
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,279
It's not in vain.

265
00:12:39,799 --> 00:12:40,720
In terms of state governance,

266
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:41,639
military affairs,

267
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,480
and court maneuvers,

268
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:44,440
there is no one in the world

269
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:45,919
who can match him.

270
00:12:47,159 --> 00:12:48,200
As for Ye Xuan,

271
00:12:48,919 --> 00:12:50,399
he can go into battle,

272
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,360
but if you ask him to make strategic plans,

273
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:54,080
it's like forcing a duck onto a perch.

274
00:12:54,919 --> 00:12:56,240
As for me,

275
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,080
I can drink,

276
00:12:58,559 --> 00:12:59,639
and have fun,

277
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:02,240
but I can't take the responsibility

278
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,039
of the country.

279
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,879
Yexuan can learn,

280
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:10,759
so can you.

281
00:13:10,799 --> 00:13:11,600
You are both making progress.

282
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:12,399
It's too late.

283
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:13,919
Phoenix.

284
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:15,879
War

285
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,120
originates from

286
00:13:17,159 --> 00:13:18,159
the dark side of human nature.

287
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,519
How can it wait for anyone?

288
00:13:26,519 --> 00:13:27,960
Don't look so sad.

289
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,200
Are you reluctant to part with me,

290
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:31,360
or with that

291
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,879
Yue Xuan who's always been so aggressive?

292
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,039
Actually,

293
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,840
I'm also reluctant to part with many things.

294
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,440
Reluctant to drink,

295
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,440
reluctant to freedom,

296
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,200
reluctant to this beautiful world.

297
00:13:50,399 --> 00:13:51,480
But what I'm most reluctant to part with

298
00:13:52,759 --> 00:13:54,600
is to see you troubled and worried.

299
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:56,720
Our little phoenix who loves painting,

300
00:13:57,399 --> 00:13:58,480
who doesn't want to move

301
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,840
on bad days,

302
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,440
How can you

303
00:14:01,559 --> 00:14:02,519
work so hard

304
00:14:03,399 --> 00:14:04,480
for Gu Jiachen's business?

305
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,120
If you are willing,

306
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,679
can you give me a gift?

307
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,399
Draw a picture with me.

308
00:14:14,159 --> 00:14:15,120
No Gu Jiachen,

309
00:14:15,759 --> 00:14:16,440
no Ye Xuan,

310
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,240
no Ruan Che,

311
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,279
just you and me.

312
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:44,080
But the paper and paint are too pricey.

313
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,919
This money can only get the cheapest.

314
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:48,840
If I could take on some private work...

315
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,919
Female painter?

316
00:14:51,159 --> 00:14:52,279
When did we get

317
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:52,960
such a

318
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,000
lively phoenix in the palace?

319
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:57,600
This is just a deposit.

320
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,360
If you want more,

321
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:01,559
paint it as I say.

322
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:03,679
Fine.

323
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,320
If the dog won't do it, I will.

324
00:15:08,279 --> 00:15:08,799
Phoenix,

325
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,879
do you know the light in your eyes

326
00:15:12,759 --> 00:15:14,120
outshines all the lanterns?

327
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:16,639
Boss,

328
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,679
your sweet talk

329
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:20,200
could fill a book.

330
00:15:22,759 --> 00:15:23,519
Do you like it?

331
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:27,639
I've never liked any other girl.

332
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,000
The one I like

333
00:15:32,159 --> 00:15:33,080
has always been

334
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:35,480
you.

335
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,240
It's done.

336
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,440
Phoenix,

337
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,440
thank you for showing up

338
00:17:29,559 --> 00:17:30,599
in my life.

339
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:33,960
This life of mine

340
00:17:34,759 --> 00:17:35,599
is already worth it.

341
00:17:43,039 --> 00:17:43,680
It's just that

342
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,720
in the next life, be a bit pickier.

343
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,680
Don't fall for Gu Jiachen, that blockhead.

344
00:17:50,799 --> 00:17:52,000
Take a good look at me.

345
00:18:24,359 --> 00:18:24,880
[From now on,]

346
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,519
[remember to smile more.]

347
00:18:27,319 --> 00:18:27,920
[Be free,]

348
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,880
[do what you want to do,]

349
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,839
[and always be brilliant,]

350
00:18:34,039 --> 00:18:34,799
[just like that night]

351
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,920
[at the Spring Breeze Tavern.]

352
00:18:50,079 --> 00:18:51,440
One day with you in this mortal world.

353
00:18:52,759 --> 00:18:53,559
[I would cast away my robe without regret,]

354
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,000
[and without a return.]

355
00:19:18,759 --> 00:19:19,200
Fu Yi,

356
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,200
you won't disappear.

357
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:23,440
I will bring you,

358
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:25,119
Chen,

359
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,839
and Gu Jiachen

360
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,359
back.

361
00:19:34,079 --> 00:19:35,160
There are words on it.

362
00:19:41,119 --> 00:19:42,160
Soul-binding.

363
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:45,960
Take the caster as the weapon

364
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:49,079
to bind the soul.

365
00:19:50,079 --> 00:19:51,440
It can't be killed or destroyed.

366
00:19:52,599 --> 00:19:53,759
Bind the soul.

367
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:56,759
It can't be killed or destroyed.
